{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","color":"3","text":"← [[GGYGO_架构总览.canvas|返回总览]]　·　文字说明见 [[计划蓝图]] 第 3、5、6、7 章\n\n# AbilitySystem 层\n\n绿色 = 阶段 1 已实现并通过编译　·　橙色 = 尚未实现\n所有文件在 `Source/GGYGO/AbilitySystem/`","x":-660,"y":-260,"width":620,"height":200},
		{"id":"asc","type":"text","color":"4","text":"## ASC · 已实现\n\n`GGYGOAbilitySystemComponent`\n\n**输入三缓存**：Pressed / Held / Released\n`ProcessAbilityInput` 四阶段：\n收集 held → 收集 pressed → 统一激活 → 派发 released\n\n分三阶段的原因：若 held 先激活，紧接着 pressed\n会把同一次按下当成输入事件发给刚创建的实例\n\n**当前无调用方** —— 需要 HeroComponent 每帧驱动","x":20,"y":-280,"width":560,"height":300},
		{"id":"groups","type":"text","color":"4","text":"## 组仲裁 · 最小实现\n\n`ActiveAbilitiesByGroup`\n`TMap<Tag, TArray<TWeakObjectPtr<GA>>>`\n\n**三个正交维度**\n组身份 `GroupTag`（GA 上）\n组规则 `GroupRule`（独立 DataAsset，尚未建）\n自身策略 `SelfPolicy` + `Priority`（GA 上）\n\n**D4 的落点在两处比较符号**\n`IsActivationBlockedByGroup` 用 `>`（同级不阻断）\n`AddAbilityToActivationGroup` 同组取消用 `<=`\n两者拼起来 = 后来者打断先激活者\n\n阶段 3 接入 GroupConfig 后才支持每组配规则","x":640,"y":-280,"width":580,"height":360},
		{"id":"ga","type":"text","color":"4","text":"## GA 基类 · 已实现（抽象）\n\n`Abilities/GGYGOGameplayAbility`\n\n默认策略：`InstancedPerActor` + `LocalPredicted` + `ReplicateNo`\n字段：`ActivationPolicy` / `GroupTag` /\n`ActivationPriority` / `SelfPolicy` / `AdditionalCosts`\n\n`SetCanBeCanceled`：只有 `Exclusive` 能拒绝取消\n（否则组仲裁无法执行）\n\n**尚无任何具体派生类**，不能直接激活","x":20,"y":100,"width":560,"height":300},
		{"id":"cost","type":"text","color":"4","text":"## 可插拔消耗 · 基类已实现\n\n`Abilities/GGYGOAbilityCost`\n\n`CheckCost` / `ApplyCost` / `bOnlyApplyCostOnHit`\n\n「仅命中后扣」的判定由 GA 统一处理，\n派生类不用自己查命中。\n用于连段计数只在打中时推进。\n\n具体派生（耐力、能量）待实现","x":640,"y":140,"width":580,"height":260},
		{"id":"attrs","type":"text","color":"4","text":"## AttributeSet · 已实现\n\n`Attributes/GGYGOAttributeSetBase`（基类）\n`Attributes/GGYGOHealthSet`：Health / MaxHealth /\n　Poise / MaxPoise（复制）\n　+ Damage / Healing / PoiseDamage（元属性，不复制）\n`Attributes/GGYGOCombatSet`：BaseDamage / BaseHeal /\n　BasePoiseDamage（`COND_OwnerOnly`）\n\n**元属性链路**：Execution 只写元属性 →\n`PostGameplayEffectExecute` 转成 Health/Poise 增减\n→ Clamp → 广播 → 清零\n\n韧性并入 HealthSet：同一次命中同时改两者\n\n类名是 `...Base` 因为旧单体 Set 仍占用正名","x":20,"y":460,"width":560,"height":380},
		{"id":"context","type":"text","color":"4","text":"## EffectContext · 已实现\n\n`GGYGOGameplayEffectContext`\n`GGYGOAbilitySystemGlobals`\n`GGYGOAbilitySourceInterface`\n\n携带 `AbilitySourceObject`（弱引用，**不复制**）\n与 `HitID`，让伤害结算能取衰减系数、\n让 Cue 能按命中材质分流\n\n**必须在 DefaultGame.ini 注册 Globals**，\n否则 `ExtractEffectContext` 恒返回 nullptr 且不报错","x":640,"y":460,"width":580,"height":300},
		{"id":"tagrel","type":"text","color":"4","text":"## Tag 关系表 · 已实现\n\n`GGYGOAbilityTagRelationshipMapping`\n\n表达「语义互斥」：任何 `Ability.Attack` 阻断 `Ability.Sprint`\n与组优先级互补 —— 后者表达「谁顶掉谁」\n\n判定顺序：先组优先级，后 Tag 关系\n\n`IsAbilityCancelledByTag` 刻意用精确相等而非层级匹配，\n避免取消误伤子类能力","x":20,"y":900,"width":560,"height":280},
		{"id":"todo","type":"text","color":"2","text":"## 尚未实现的子目录\n\n`Executions/` 伤害与削韧结算（阶段 9）\n`Calculations/` Modifier 数值计算\n`Effects/` C++ 侧 GE 与全局引用集中点\n`Cues/` CueManager + Burst / Looping Notify（阶段 8）\n`Tasks/` PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent、WaitForHit（阶段 8）\n`TargetData/` 命中数据结构\n`Phases/` GamePhase（暂缓）\n`Groups/` 的 GroupConfig DataAsset（阶段 3）\n`Abilities/Costs/` 具体消耗派生\n\n还缺 `GGYGOGlobalAbilitySystem`：\n队伍级 Buff 广播，阶段 10 需要","x":640,"y":820,"width":580,"height":360}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e-asc-ga","fromNode":"asc","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"ga","toSide":"top","label":"TryActivateAbility"},
